  "type_pretty": "True ↔\n  ∀ (n : ℕ) (V : Type) [inst : Fintype V],\n    Fintype.card V = 5 * n →\n      ∀ (G : SimpleGraph V), G.CliqueFree 3 → ∃ H ≤ G, H.IsBipartite ∧ (G.edgeFinset \\ H.edgeFinset).card ≤ n ^ 2"
